# MicroFilm environment variables (example)

# Get a free API key at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key below.
# NOTE: .env is gitignored (per CLAUDE.md convention) so your key stays local.
# Since this is a front-end-only Vite app, any value here is embedded in the
# client bundle — use a TMDB read-only/API key and avoid reusing secrets.

VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=
